# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  EligibilityService API – REST + GraphQL Tests
#  Requires: VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
#  API Base : http://localhost:5174
#
#  STEP 1: Run request §1.1 (POST /api/auth/token) → copy token from response
#  STEP 2: Paste it in @token below, then run any other request
#
#  Auth: POST /api/auth/token  credentials: admin / Admin@123
#  JWT : Issuer=EligibilityService  Audience=EligibilityServiceClients
#
#  SEEDED DATA (canteenUnit=10001):
#    ShiftA + itemCode=1001  eligibleLimit=2  timeOfficeUnit=T01
#    ShiftB + itemCode=1001  eligibleLimit=2  timeOfficeUnit=T01
#    ShiftC + itemCode=1002  eligibleLimit=1  timeOfficeUnit=T01
#    ShiftG + itemCode=1002  eligibleLimit=1  timeOfficeUnit=T01
#  ShiftMappings: CompanyCode=10001 ShiftCode A/B/C/G
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl    = http://localhost:5174
@token      = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsImp0aSI6IjMwYTVkMmE4LWMwN2ItNGE0Ni1hMWMwLWVhODBhODcyMDg4MCIsImh0dHA6Ly9zY2hlbWFzLnhtbHNvYXAub3JnL3dzLzIwMDUvMDUvaWRlbnRpdHkvY2xhaW1zL25hbWUiOiJhZG1pbiIsImV4cCI6MTc3NDUwODczNSwiaXNzIjoiRWxpZ2liaWxpdHlTZXJ2aWNlIiwiYXVkIjoiRWxpZ2liaWxpdHlTZXJ2aWNlQ2xpZW50cyJ9._pnRDtButGP5GH1LxnNmfHPlr72COGrSpt1AAFcda3k
