# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1  AUTHENTICATION
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1.1 POST – Get JWT token  ← run this first, paste token above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

### 1.2 Invalid credentials (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong"
}

###

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2  HEALTH CHECKS
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2.1 Full health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2.2 DB readiness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/db
Accept: application/json

